@server = http://localhost:3000

### Inscription d'un nouvel utilisateur
POST {{server}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rayan", "email": "rayan@example.com", "password": "motdepasse123" }

### Même email une deuxième fois
POST {{server}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Rayan", "email": "rayan@example.com", "password": "motdepasse123" }

### Connexion de John
POST {{server}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "john.doe@example.com", "password": "topsecret" }

### Mauvais mot de passe
POST {{server}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "john.doe@example.com", "password": "pasbon" }

### Email inconnu
POST {{server}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "personne@example.com", "password": "topsecret" }
